{"unit_id":"seaison__dsh-plugin-eva-theme#card-zh","repo":"seaison/dsh-plugin-eva-theme","commit":"f8b96381ceda724c58e79ec375e0dfe08d244349","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH EVA Theme 是面向 DSH Web 的 Evangelion 双角色主题插件，以宿主主题令牌和界面覆盖层将深色模式映射为明日香配色、浅色模式映射为绫波丽配色。它还提供可重播的启动认证流程、驾驶员选择与语音、时钟和 TPS 仪表、系统音乐控制、提示音及显示设置。用户可调整组件尺寸、角色背景和装饰选项，偏好会自动保存。适合希望为 DSH 工作台换肤并加入 EVA 风格开场与桌面组件的用户；音乐播放器仅支持 macOS，余额显示可选使用 DeepSeek 凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:89-120","lib/client.js:2813-3242","lib/client.js:3348-3457","lib/index.js:67-194"]}
{"unit_id":"seaison__dsh-plugin-eva-theme#card-en","repo":"seaison/dsh-plugin-eva-theme","commit":"f8b96381ceda724c58e79ec375e0dfe08d244349","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH EVA Theme gives the DSH web client Asuka colors in dark mode and Rei Ayanami colors in light mode. It adds pilot selection, voice startup, a clock, TPS display, system music controls, alerts, and customizable widgets. Music control is macOS only; balance display is optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:89-120","lib/client.js:2813-3242","lib/client.js:3348-3457","lib/index.js:67-194"]}
