{"unit_id":"seaison__dsh-plugin-eva-theme#feature-theme","repo":"seaison/dsh-plugin-eva-theme","commit":"f8b96381ceda724c58e79ec375e0dfe08d244349","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH EVA Theme 的功能「双角色换肤」：深色模式使用明日香配色，浅色模式使用绫波丽配色，并通过 DSH 主题令牌与覆盖层呈现装饰。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:89-120","lib/client.js:3427-3437"]}
{"unit_id":"seaison__dsh-plugin-eva-theme#feature-boot","repo":"seaison/dsh-plugin-eva-theme","commit":"f8b96381ceda724c58e79ec375e0dfe08d244349","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH EVA Theme 的功能「驾驶员启动流程」：首次启动可播放 NERV 动画、警报、驾驶员选择与同步语音，并在完成后进入聊天；设置面板可重新播放。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2813-3242","lib/client.js:1820-1860"]}
{"unit_id":"seaison__dsh-plugin-eva-theme#feature-dashboard","repo":"seaison/dsh-plugin-eva-theme","commit":"f8b96381ceda724c58e79ec375e0dfe08d244349","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH EVA Theme 的功能「工作台仪表」：在界面叠加时钟、中央角色状态与 TPS 波形，并显示计费时段标签和切换倒计时。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2005-2063","lib/client.js:2223-2417"]}
{"unit_id":"seaison__dsh-plugin-eva-theme#feature-music","repo":"seaison/dsh-plugin-eva-theme","commit":"f8b96381ceda724c58e79ec375e0dfe08d244349","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH EVA Theme 的功能「系统音乐控制」：检测当前播放曲目后显示播放器，可查询曲目信息、暂停、上一首或下一首；该系统媒体功能只在 macOS 提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2064-2214","lib/index.js:111-193","lib/system-nowplaying.jxa:1-46"]}
{"unit_id":"seaison__dsh-plugin-eva-theme#feature-attention","repo":"seaison/dsh-plugin-eva-theme","commit":"f8b96381ceda724c58e79ec375e0dfe08d244349","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH EVA Theme 的功能「角色语音提醒」：可在人工待审核或主会话正常完成时排队播放当前驾驶员语音，并可在设置中试听或关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2664-2810"]}
{"unit_id":"seaison__dsh-plugin-eva-theme#feature-settings","repo":"seaison/dsh-plugin-eva-theme","commit":"f8b96381ceda724c58e79ec375e0dfe08d244349","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH EVA Theme 的功能「显示设置」：通过面板调整时钟与仪表尺寸、角色背景、提醒声音和装饰排版；更改即时生效并自动保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1494-1642","lib/client.js:1767-1869","lib/client.js:3348-3382"]}
{"unit_id":"seaison__dsh-plugin-eva-theme#feature-balance","repo":"seaison/dsh-plugin-eva-theme","commit":"f8b96381ceda724c58e79ec375e0dfe08d244349","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH EVA Theme 的功能「DeepSeek 余额显示」：可选读取账户余额并格式化为界面标签；没有凭据时该功能返回无密钥状态，其他主题功能仍可使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host-balance.mjs:13-25","lib/index.js:81-108","lib/client.js:2259-2323"]}
{"unit_id":"seaison__dsh-plugin-eva-theme#caveat-platform","repo":"seaison/dsh-plugin-eva-theme","commit":"f8b96381ceda724c58e79ec375e0dfe08d244349","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH EVA Theme 使用系统媒体读取和控制提供音乐播放器；代码仅在 macOS 调用 osascript，其他平台不会提供系统音乐控制。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:111-124","lib/system-nowplaying.jxa:1-8"]}
{"unit_id":"seaison__dsh-plugin-eva-theme#caveat-balance","repo":"seaison/dsh-plugin-eva-theme","commit":"f8b96381ceda724c58e79ec375e0dfe08d244349","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH EVA Theme 的余额标签会请求 api.deepseek.com；需要 DSH 凭据服务中配置 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY。未配置时余额项不可用，主题其余功能仍然独立运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host-balance.mjs:13-16","lib/index.js:81-108"]}
